  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: S5-E  CRITTERS
  body: 'Press G for labels. Three small creatures wander ahead. They are harmless.

    EXPECT:
    each has ONE attach point (the number shows 1). Press Z until one is outlined,
    press 3 (Melee) and TAP twice: the first troop attaches (number 0, label ATTACHED
    1/1), the second is a light attacker at half damage (LIGHT 1). The two small
    critters die in 3 hits (30 health). The third has 150 health, raised for this
    test only so you have time to watch.'
  radius: 3
