  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: HUB
  body: 'Walk to a station with its F key. Stand on a green pad to read what to test.

    F2
    Targeting   F3 Sweep   F4 Hostiles   F5 Carry + Waypoints

    F6 Breakables  
    F7 Pickups   F8 Failures   F9 Combat

    F1 back to Hub   F12 reset the station  
    H hide controls   G combat debug panel'
  radius: 5
